    intro: 'Drive time is pure cost in landscaping. Every mile between jobs burns fuel and pays a crew to sit in a truck instead of working. When routes are planned by habit or a quick glance at a map, the waste adds up to hours every week. [Landscaping software](/landscaping-software) optimizes routes so crews drive the shortest sensible path between stops, fitting more billable work into the same day. The office builds a tight route in seconds instead of puzzling over addresses, and the crew follows a clear order without backtracking across town. Less windshield time means more revenue from the same trucks and the same hours. IndustryBossPro is the all in one platform that bundles every tool into one login at a flat 199 dollars per month, so routing connects to scheduling and time tracking in one system.',
