    slug: 'landscaping-time-tracking-software',
    title: 'Landscaping Software for Accurate Crew Time Tracking',
    description: 'See how landscaping software captures crew hours from the field so payroll is accurate, job costs are real, and time theft disappears.',
    date: '2025-02-24',
